<%# Unchecked saves a draft. A record with no stored answer yet is shown as
    checked, so saving keeps publishing by default; once an answer is stored,
    including one from a submit that failed validation, that is what shows.
    The publication date partial that follows is shown only while this box
    is checked (plugins/cas_published_at.js). %>
<p>
  <%= f.input :published,
    as: :boolean,
    label: 'Publicado?',
    input_html: { checked: f.object.published.nil? || f.object.published? } %>
</p>
